<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>EP31｜空间与时间导航</title><style>__STYLES__</style></head><body>
<header><div class="eyebrow">雾峡轨城 · EP31 · 公开版空间导航</div><h1>从夹层后口，到泵房外墙</h1><p class="muted">把地点、通路与同一段时间里的行动放在一起看。<span class="badge">空间数值仍为工作规划</span></p><nav class="header-links"><a href="index.html">查看全城立体基准</a><a href="__NOVEL_URL__">阅读公开版小说</a><a href="#review">填写空间意见</a></nav></header>
<main><section id="load-status" class="loading" role="alert"><strong id="load-title">正在读取空间数据…</strong><p id="load-detail">完整数据已随页面保存，可离线打开。</p><p><button id="reload" onclick="location.reload()">重新加载</button> <a href="__FALLBACK_URL__">返回全城视图</a></p></section><noscript><p class="loading error">当前浏览器没有执行 JavaScript，三维图与时间联动无法运行。<a href="__TEXT_URL__">查看文字空间规划</a>。</p></noscript>
<div id="app" class="pending">
<div class="capture-controls"><button id="capture-all">一键截图本集全部空间</button><span id="capture-status" role="status">每处导出斜视、俯视和左斜视右俯视并排图，打包下载。</span><a id="capture-download" hidden>重新下载截图包</a></div>
<section class="timebar" aria-label="故事时间"><div class="time-head"><strong id="time-label">故事第 0 分钟</strong><span class="muted">故事经过时间 · 共34分钟</span><button id="prev-event">上个事件</button><button id="next-event">下个事件</button></div><div class="range-wrap"><input id="time" type="range" min="0" max="34" step="1" value="0" aria-label="故事分钟"><div id="event-rail" class="event-rail"></div></div><div class="event-summary"><strong id="phase-title"></strong><p id="phase-detail"></p></div></section>
<section class="board"><div class="map-pane"><div class="controls"><label>查看 <select id="view"><option value="overview">全程与位置关系</option><option value="sorting">分拣场</option><option value="warehouse">饼摊仓库</option><option value="discard">弃甲验证区</option><option value="reception">L3接应凹间</option><option value="pool">双水槽与泵房</option></select></label><span class="spacer"></span><button id="zoom-in" aria-label="放大地图">＋</button><span id="zoom-readout">100%</span><button id="zoom-out" aria-label="缩小地图">−</button><button id="fit">显示全景</button><button id="pan" aria-pressed="false">拖动平移</button><button id="oblique">标准斜视</button><button id="top">俯视</button><button id="rotate">转动90°</button></div><div class="legend"><span><i class="main"></i>步小蛮一行</span><span><i class="lin"></i>林逸接应</span><span><i class="enemy"></i>敌方</span><span><i class="white"></i>白塔机器人</span></div><div class="reference-bar"><svg id="orientation" role="img" aria-label="随主图转动的空间方向轴"></svg><div><label><input type="checkbox" id="reference-toggle" checked> 参考网格</label><p id="direction-meaning" class="direction-meaning"></p><p id="direction-note"></p></div></div><div class="map-frame"><svg id="map" role="group" aria-label="可缩放、平移和点选的EP31空间关系图"></svg></div><p id="reference-note" class="reference-note"></p><p class="map-help">滚轮缩放 · 拖动旋转 · Shift拖动或“拖动平移”移动地图 · 点地点或路线查看详情</p><div class="node-buttons" id="node-buttons" aria-label="定位地点"></div><div class="status"><strong id="location-now"></strong><p id="scene-notice" class="scene-notice"></p></div><p id="space-detail" class="muted description"></p></div>
<aside class="context-pane"><section class="context-card"><h2>这里在全城的哪里</h2><svg id="city" role="img" aria-label="筒形城市与当前地点定位"></svg><p id="city-place"></p><p id="city-coords" class="context-coords muted"></p><p class="muted">筒壁切片用于说明结构，宽度不代表本集范围。外径128公里、筒深80公里为工作比例。</p></section><details class="profile-card" open><summary>沿路线看高低</summary><svg id="height-profile" role="group" aria-label="由现有地点和路长自动生成的高度剖面"></svg><p id="profile-current"></p><p id="profile-note" class="muted"></p></details><section class="selection-card" id="selection" aria-live="polite"></section></aside></section>
<h2>同一分钟，各方在做什么</h2><p class="muted">点时间条可跳到该段开始；细线是真实分钟位置。人物站位取关键事件示意，两个事件之间不虚构逐秒动作。</p><div class="lanes"><svg id="lanes" role="group" aria-label="0至34分钟四方行动时间线"></svg></div><div id="lane-state" class="lane-state" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="traffic-condition" class="condition"></div>
<h2>点一段路，核对怎么过去</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table class="timetable"><thead><tr><th>路线</th><th>行动窗口</th><th>约路长</th><th>高差与通行方式</th></tr></thead><tbody id="legs"></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">连接线表达场景相邻关系；路长包含实际绕行、坡道与升降台乘行。窗口包含该段行动及事件，不能直接当作纯走路时间。</p>
<h2 id="review">关键动作与空间复核</h2><div class="cards" id="checks"></div><h2>整段空间意见</h2><textarea id="overall" placeholder="可直接写空间、路线或时间的修改意见。"></textarea><div class="actions"><button id="agree">全部同意</button><button id="generate">生成反馈</button><button id="copy">复制反馈</button><button id="download">下载反馈</button></div><p id="save-status" role="status"></p><textarea id="feedback-output" hidden readonly aria-label="空间审阅反馈"></textarea><details><summary>空间版本与资料边界</summary><div class="evidence" id="evidence"></div></details></div></main><footer>公开版工作空间 · <a href="README.md">使用说明与许可</a>。填写或导出意见不自动定稿，也不写入 Obsidian。</footer>
<script>
window.spaceReady=false;window.spaceFailed=false;window.spaceFail=function(message){window.spaceFailed=true;const box=document.getElementById('load-status');box.hidden=false;box.classList.add('error');document.getElementById('load-title').textContent='空间页面未能完成加载';document.getElementById('load-detail').textContent=String(message||'页面数据或脚本未能正常运行，请重新加载或返回全城视图。');document.getElementById('app').classList.add('pending');};window.addEventListener('error',e=>window.spaceFail(e.message));window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',e=>window.spaceFail(e.reason?.message||e.reason));setTimeout(()=>{if(!window.spaceReady&&!window.spaceFailed)window.spaceFail('空间数据或脚本没有完成初始化，请重新加载或返回全城视图。');},5000);
</script>
<script type="application/json" id="space-packet">__PACKET__</script><script>__LOGIC__
__APP__</script></body></html>
